+-\x1b[1m DeviceChain - dcctl install - kind devicechain \x1b[m------------- dcctl v1.12.0 -+
| \x1b[1mHelp\x1b[m - Review                                                                |
|                                                                              |
| Tab         action                                                           |
| Enter       select                                                           |
| up/down     scroll                                                           |
| Esc         back                                                             |
| q           exit                                                             |
| ?/F1        help                                                             |
| Ctrl+C      exit                                                             |
|                                                                              |
| Approve starts the install of the plan shown, and only once this screen has  |
| settled: a key pressed before then does nothing. Opening, scrolling and      |
| closing help are keys too, so the screen settles again after help closes.    |
| Back returns to the choices. Nothing has been changed yet: nothing on these  |
| screens changes anything until you approve the plan on the review. Ctrl+C    |
| exits.                                                                       |
|                                                                              |
|                                                                              |
|                                                                              |
|                                                                              |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Esc close help - Ctrl+C exit                                                 |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
